:null},{"k":"2:82","t":"But they who believe and do righteous deeds - those are the companions of Paradise; they will abide therein eternally.","j":1,"h":2,"s":2,"a":82,"sd":null},{"k":"2:83","t":"And [recall] when We took the covenant from the Children of Israel, [enjoining upon them], \"Do not worship except Allāh; and to parents do good and to relatives, orphans, and the needy. And speak to people good [words] and establish prayer and give zakāh.\" Then you turned away, except a few of you, and you were refusing.","j":1,"h":2,"s":2,"a":83,"sd":null}],"juz":1,"hizb":2,"surahs":[2],"sajdah":false}